WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,930
Need two administrator cards

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,370
Only then can you enter the hidden floor

3
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,920
This place is not simple

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,200
Wait until we finish

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,360
I'll send you up

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,240
But if something happens to you

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,400
How do we get up there? Of course you guys

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,880
Buried with us

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,040
Who let you come in here?

10
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,780
I give you my key card

11
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,880
If we can't come back

12
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,120
You can go up yourselves

13
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,280
How could you, Captain Huang?

14
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,900
Just be responsible for your job

15
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:41,400
This is it
